# Flying from a cockpit with the buttons: in a cockpit that has a cockpit rig (the small cockpit here), A raises the ship and
# the grips roll it, with the thumbsticks left to the rig's own sticks. Sat down by the game's Use (a setup step); the
# hand entry is tested in seats-pilot-seat-enter-leave. Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1 from Earth Planet.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- Setup: the ship's cockpit, and sit in it -----------------
admin creativeTools
# Earth Planet's ships belong to the world's own identity: the game lets the player control them once they own them
own Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
head 0 1.6 0
wait 1
# the game's Use on the cockpit (the ship stands high on its landing gear, out of reach from the ground)
control Cockpit on Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
wait 2
read character
expect state == sitting
expect controlledEntity.type == MyCockpit
expect log VR controls: ship controller (Cockpit) within 5
wait 1

# ---- A held raises the ship ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
read grid Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
mark
press right a
wait 3
release right a
read grid Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
expect position moved > 0.5

# ---- Right grip rolls the ship: the pilot's up turns (the seat turns with the ship) ----------------------------------
# Hands kept at the sides, away from the cockpit's sticks.
hand left -0.3 0.9 -0.1
hand right 0.3 0.9 -0.1
read character
mark
press right grip
wait 2
release right grip
wait 0.5
read character
expect up moved > 0.05

# ---- Hold Y to get up ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
press left b
wait 0.8
release left b
wait 2
read character
expect state != sitting
